Cell["\<\
Mathematica provides a wide range of alternative methods to compute \
probability density functions from data. Another algorithm generates smoothed \
probability densities:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9489903757735767`*^9, 
  3.948990444369851*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4701e7ae-8c94-422a-a779-\
76fd865653e7"],

